{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の\n京都の全国握手会ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念願のスナック眞緒レーンが叶って\n内心とても嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この気持ちをもっとまなもに伝えればよかったなあ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、まなもと遊べてなくて実は寂しい、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏は絶対にお茶のあそこに行こうね！\nあとは大阪ぶっ倒れツアーもやりたい笑まなもはぶっ倒れツアーはやだと言いそう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校頑張ってーー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJBY80TM3X0QNQ241EGA6J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJBZ6SB1DNXMBW10Q55YPH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなもは、大切なスナック眞緒のバイトちゃんであり、私が全身預けて信頼できるパートナーです💓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学のちょっとませた1番可愛がってる後輩みたいな感じの存在！わかるかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学ではなかなかそんな後輩ができる前にアイドルになったから\nまなもみたいな後輩ができて私はとても嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなもはなんかプライベート感強めな存在です･:*+.\\(( °ω° ))/.:+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出会ってくれてありがとう！\nこれからもよろしくね〜\nと、なんか改めて、よそよそしいことを言ってみました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くスナック眞緒を立て直さなきゃ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJC07Q6JFAFZ8CZM8J5FV9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJC1WYVW7BB3CEYXDT63JY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJC2VYKBTCSMD46A8ACT08","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJC3V58RQ9E2X247CBZ6T7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJC4VRYMZZ3EVSV8ZG0FQT","alt":""},{"type":"paragrap